# CatDex — Badges & Achievements

## Sources

- Profile badges builders in `src/lib/progression.ts` (`buildProfileBadges` et al.)
- First-capture / cat-related badge copy helpers (`catBadgeTitle`)
- Reward flow may show a badge beat after the first capture

## Design

- Use CatDex icon language (`badge`, `xp`, `paw`) — not ad-hoc emoji walls
- Badge moments are part of the **celebration choreography**, secondary to the cat reveal
- Keep names short FR labels

## Rules

- Achievements should reflect real collection/mission state
- Avoid notifying the same badge repeatedly across sessions without persist guards
- New badges need: id, title, unlock rule, where surfaced (reward / profile)
